<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="543959231"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1116716471"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Back Where I Belong"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Avicii / Otto Knows"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Festival Favorites (The ADE 2016 Edition) - Armada Music"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:49.110"><div begin="00:17.100" end="02:49.110"><p begin="00:17.100" end="00:19.526" itunes:key="L27239">Step off the train at dawn<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走进黎明的光晕里</span></p><p begin="00:20.048" end="00:22.912" itunes:key="L27240">Back in the place where I was born<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回到我出生的故乡</span></p><p begin="00:24.053" end="00:27.144" itunes:key="L27241">It's been ten years since I've been gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已离开长达十年之久</span></p><p begin="00:27.832" end="00:30.821" itunes:key="L27242">It took me ten years to know I'm wrong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">差不多十年 我才知道是我错了</span></p><p begin="00:32.298" end="00:36.007" itunes:key="L27243">I've been everywhere and nothing is new<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去过很多地方 对我来说已没什么特别</span></p><p begin="00:36.017" end="00:39.815" itunes:key="L27244">And I've done everything I've set out to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也实现了心底渴望实现的梦想</span></p><p begin="00:39.825" end="00:41.664" itunes:key="L27245">I'm nothing without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的我一无是处</span></p><p begin="00:41.674" end="00:45.653" itunes:key="L27246">Without you I'm nothing at all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的我一无所有</span></p><p begin="00:47.141" end="00:49.754" itunes:key="L27247">Now I'm back where I belong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我重回我的归属之地</span></p><p begin="00:51.215" end="00:54.417" itunes:key="L27248">No matter where I've roamed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我来自哪里</span></p><p begin="00:54.427" end="00:58.221" itunes:key="L27249">It's been here all along<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会归属这里</span></p><p begin="00:58.895" end="01:02.231" itunes:key="L27250">I've finally made it home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于回到属于我的家</span></p><p begin="01:17.641" end="01:20.231" itunes:key="L27251">Don't know the price of time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不懂时间的珍贵</span></p><p begin="01:21.247" end="01:23.896" itunes:key="L27252">Until you know what life can buy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到你明白人生会换来什么</span></p><p begin="01:24.806" end="01:27.647" itunes:key="L27253">You know I hope the world's been kind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我希望世界能仁慈一些</span></p><p begin="01:28.883" end="01:31.720" itunes:key="L27254">Hope you can see it in my eyes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你能在我眼里看出来</span></p><p begin="01:33.091" end="01:36.962" itunes:key="L27255">That I've been everywhere and nothing is new<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去过很多地方 对我来说已没什么特别</span></p><p begin="01:36.972" end="01:40.806" itunes:key="L27256">And I've done everything I've set out to do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也实现了心底渴望实现的梦想</span></p><p begin="01:40.816" end="01:42.788" itunes:key="L27257">I'm nothing without you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的我一无是处</span></p><p begin="01:42.798" end="01:47.032" itunes:key="L27258">Without you I'm nothing at all<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的我一无所有</span></p><p begin="01:48.093" end="01:50.498" itunes:key="L27259">Now I'm back where I belong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我重回我的归属之地</span></p><p begin="01:52.195" end="01:54.864" itunes:key="L27260">No matter where I've roamed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我来自哪里</span></p><p begin="01:55.992" end="01:58.387" itunes:key="L27261">It's been here all along<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会归属这里</span></p><p begin="01:59.763" end="02:03.281" itunes:key="L27262">I've finally made it home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于回到属于我的家</span></p><p begin="02:15.004" end="02:18.196" itunes:key="L27263">I've finally made it home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于回到属于我的家</span></p><p begin="02:33.801" end="02:36.489" itunes:key="L27264">Now I'm back where I belong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我重回我的归属之地</span></p><p begin="02:37.896" end="02:40.662" itunes:key="L27265">No matter where I've roamed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论我来自哪里</span></p><p begin="02:41.430" end="02:44.200" itunes:key="L27266">It's been here all along<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会归属这里</span></p><p begin="02:45.499" end="02:49.110" itunes:key="L27267">I've finally made it home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于回到属于我的家</span></p></div></body></tt>